sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Alice as Sender (User A)
    actor Bob as Receiver (User B)
    participant UI as Next.js Chat Window
    participant CC as ChatController (/api/chat)
    participant Hub as ChatHub (SignalR /hubs)
    participant Redis as Redis Backplane
    participant RRS as IResponseRateService
    participant DB as MongoDB (Conversations, ChatMessages)

    Note over Alice,Bob: Realtime Connection Setup
    Bob->>Hub: Connect (SignalR wss://.../hubs)
    Hub->>Redis: Register ConnectionId for Bob.UserId
    Alice->>Hub: Connect (SignalR wss://.../hubs)
    Hub->>Redis: Register ConnectionId for Alice.UserId

    Note over Alice,DB: Sending Message
    Alice->>UI: Types & sends message
    UI->>CC: POST /api/chat/conversations/{id}/messages
    CC->>DB: Query Conversation (Validate Alice is participant)
    alt Unauthorized
        CC-->>UI: 403 Forbidden
    else Authorized
        CC->>DB: Insert into ChatMessages collection
        CC->>DB: Update Conversations.LastMessageAt, LastMessagePreview
        CC->>RRS: RecordResponseMetrics(senderId, recipientId)
        CC->>Hub: Clients.User(Bob.UserId).SendAsync("ReceiveMessage", message)
        Hub->>Redis: Publish to Bob's cluster node
        Redis->>Bob: Deliver message in realtime via SignalR
        CC-->>UI: 200 OK (Message entity)
    end
